{
  "slug": "carta-cap-table",
  "name": "Carta Cap Table",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Carta Cap Table plugin — skills and hooks for querying cap tables, grants, SAFEs, 409A valuations, waterfall scenarios, and more",
  "longDescription": "Ships **19 skills** and **5 hooks**.\n\n- **Skills** (19): `carta-compensation-app` (Serves a live, clickable CTC console — builds one corporation's Carta Total Compensation data into a React app…), `carta-compensation-benchmarks` (Retrieves Carta Total Compensation market benchmarks (salary, equity, total cash) for a role), `carta-compensation-rolematcher` (Classify a job title or description into the CTC taxonomy (job area, focus, level, track)), `carta-compensation-scorecard` (Carta Total Compensation scorecard — shows how a corporation's employees compare to market), `carta-conversion-calculator` (Calculate SAFE and convertible note conversion into equity at a financing close), `carta-discover-commands` (META-DISCOVERY ONLY — answers the question \"what cap-table tools or commands exist?\" when the user is lost about…), `carta-grant-vesting` (Fetch the vesting schedule for ONE specific grant or holder — options (ISO/NSO), RSUs, SARs, or CBUs), `carta-interaction-reference` (Carta's behavioral rules for AI agents presenting cap table data — mandatory context for any Carta cap table…), and 11 more\n- **Hooks** (5): `SessionStart`, `PostModelSwitch`, `PreToolUse`, `UserPromptSubmit`, `PostToolUse`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install carta-cap-table@claude-plugins-official` from `carta/plugins` (`plugins/carta-cap-table`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 19,
    "hook": 4
  },
  "sourceType": "community",
